    "implementation_delta": "Add HermeticVfsWalRecoveryAdapter@1, DurableCurrentRootCAS@1, and VfsWalQualification@1. Hermetic WAL recovery, current-root CAS, ARC coherence, crash recovery, stale-parent/stale-root rejection, concurrent writers, restart, tombstone, invalidation, corruption, and hermetic Linux mount lifecycle were measured_hermetic. Linux FUSE, Windows WinFsp, and container FUSE stay typed unavailable: the sealed doctor does not start a live kernel or container mount, WinFsp is not present on this Linux host, and missing drivers are not recorded as zero or passing. Injected or hermetic adapters cannot mint live qualification. CLI/MCP/MCP++ VFS parity stays typed unavailable (PCPR-026). Proof-seal witness and key protection stay typed unavailable (PCPR-024). This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
